{"name": "Sunken Realms", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Alric's father descended into the ruins beneath the city years ago. He never came back.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Sunken Realms is a dungeon crawling adventure about a son who goes looking for answers. Descend into an abandoned underground city, battle monsters, collect materials, craft your gear, and master forgotten spells. Grow stronger. Go deeper. Find out what happened down there \u2014 and whether the truth is worth what it costs.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>No open world. No battle pass. Just a sword, a dungeon, and a question that won't let you go</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u></u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Features:</u></strong><br/><br/><strong><i>\u2022 Hand-crafted rooms are procedurally re-arranged every time you enter the dungeon so you'll never play the same layout twice</i></strong><br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897860/extras/5cc081e08b47dd47821a8c06061df2a4.webp?t=1789750813\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"260\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897860/extras/5cc081e08b47dd47821a8c06061df2a4.poster.avif?t=1789750813\" width=\"612\"/></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>\u2022 Fluid Melee and Ranged combat</i></strong> <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"260\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897860/extras/8029510d6ac08dbd0301670b28bdce11.poster.avif?t=1789750813\" width=\"612\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897860/extras/8029510d6ac08dbd0301670b28bdce11.webm?t=1789750813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897860/extras/8029510d6ac08dbd0301670b28bdce11.mp4?t=1789750813\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>\u2022 Learn spells to wield powerful, long-forgotten magic</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"260\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897860/extras/aff39bf8af33b26dc8ee63c586088e3c.poster.avif?t=1789750813\" width=\"612\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897860/extras/aff39bf8af33b26dc8ee63c586088e3c.webm?t=1789750813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897860/extras/aff39bf8af33b26dc8ee63c586088e3c.mp4?t=1789750813\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>\u2022 Collect gold and crafting materials from vanquished foes and treasure chests</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"260\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897860/extras/e21637abc5c83c275c05076d63bd2af2.poster.avif?t=1789750813\" width=\"612\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897860/extras/e21637abc5c83c275c05076d63bd2af2.webm?t=1789750813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897860/extras/e21637abc5c83c275c05076d63bd2af2.mp4?t=1789750813\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>\u2022 Return to camp to craft weapons, cook food, brew potions, trade, a